## Step 3 — Hover intent + typing suppression
All inside the existing `useVisibleTask$` (line 397) where `el` and `editor` live; plain closures are fine there.

Closure state, placed just above the current `mouseover` handler (~line 722):
```ts
const HOVER_INTENT_MS = 350;
let hoverTimer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | null = null;
let hoverArmed = true;
let lastMouse = { x: -1, y: -1 };
const cancelHoverIntent = () => { if (hoverTimer) { clearTimeout(hoverTimer); hoverTimer = null; } };
```

- **`mouseover` (line 723)**: `cancelHoverIntent()` first (retarget). Guards: `if (!hoverArmed) return;` and existing pinned guard. Then `hoverTimer = setTimeout(() => { hoverTimer = null; buildAndPin(noteSpan, false); }, HOVER_INTENT_MS);` instead of the immediate call.
